                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6fdc0ad6-ef9b-34fe-ad54-88dd11f46cca",
                        "entry_id": "212ef8fa-24b7-3773-87d1-1a2a2fe437ff",
                        "glosses": [
                            "heel onsmakelijk en vies"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3c03c49-2ae7-40b3-b8c2-065fc95c9c65",
                                "sense_id": "6fdc0ad6-ef9b-34fe-ad54-88dd11f46cca",
                                "text": "Ook Belgische politici van alle gezindten spraken met woorden als 'ranzig' en 'degoutant' hun ontzetting uit. \"Als je plezier hebt in de onschuldige dood van een kind, ben je ziek."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd518163-47b4-4c0c-9be7-ade94d4fc3c4",
                                "sense_id": "6fdc0ad6-ef9b-34fe-ad54-88dd11f46cca",
                                "text": "Voor PVDA-Kamerlid Raoul Hedebouw zijn de uitspraken van De Wever ‘degoutant’. ‘Het enige wat men de ouders kan verwijten is dat ze naar een betere toekomst voor hun kinderen zochten dan oorlog’, vond CDH-kamerfractieleidster Catherine Fonck, die pleitte voor ‘een minimum aan respect en empathie’."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec55a00c-32df-4f7c-b505-e66fdcf0f1c5",
                                "sense_id": "6fdc0ad6-ef9b-34fe-ad54-88dd11f46cca",
                                "text": "'Ik vind dat echt degoutant. Als je de beelden ziet van onze stranden ’s morgens, dat zijn Afrikaanse toestanden'"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "88e119b8-4520-47f4-a22a-63062b743902",
                        "source_entry_id": "212ef8fa-24b7-3773-87d1-1a2a2fe437ff",
                        "source_sense_id": "6fdc0ad6-ef9b-34fe-ad54-88dd11f46cca",
                        "target_lang_word": "disgusting",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "disgusting",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f671ce0e-6229-3ca5-88b3-a0ea2d6a2840",
                                        "entry_id": "0baa67de-a82f-3fcd-9609-0e245f24ff6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Causing disgust; repulsive; distasteful."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0fdb63f3-89be-406d-ada8-a56e732c5ca9",
                                                "sense_id": "f671ce0e-6229-3ca5-88b3-a0ea2d6a2840",
                                                "text": "The taste and digestion are often depraved, anorexia, nausea, inappetence and vomiting supervene, the woman desires innutritious or disgusting food, such as chalk, cinders, putrescent animal food, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7685284-cf5d-4520-9b05-e7cb2534ae12",
                                                "sense_id": "f671ce0e-6229-3ca5-88b3-a0ea2d6a2840",
                                                "text": "But it is much more sensible and much more fun and much more disgusting to assume that the English Leather woman is really saying \"All my men wear English leather or nothing at all.\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f266cf4-7e65-41c8-888d-b1618964b4ea",
                                                "sense_id": "f671ce0e-6229-3ca5-88b3-a0ea2d6a2840",
                                                "text": "One guy farted repeatedly and laughed out loud each time he let it out. To top off his disgusting behavior, he constantly picked his nose and thumped the waste in the air."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "disgusting",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7e4690f-26f9-383b-9c63-7606b91887bb",
